{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01CmUU6wwXPZokvbLnQNYBkv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze this task carefully. I'm running as an autodev planner phase for Beads issue `QuantAgent-uzq`. \n\nMy capabilities are:\n- read_repo: true\n- write_docs: true (this is what I should focus on)\n- write_code: false\n- write_tests: false\n- beads_read: true\n- beads_comment_final: true\n- Everything else: false\n\nThis is the **planner** phase, so my job is to:\n1. Read the issue and understand the problem\n2. Read the relevant code files\n3. Produce planning artifacts (design, implementation plan, acceptance criteria)\n\n\n4. Write docs under `docs/` and the artifacts dir\n5. Add a final Beads comment\n\nI'll start by checking the artifacts directory and reading the issue snapshot, then examine the relevant source files to create the planning documents.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":28183,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":28183},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b9b65c5-e77e-400b-90aa-d1fae3699661","uuid":"302ed3ee-9cea-41d9-9d25-ef156115c09c"}
