{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015inTTSL2miKH7DwenqN4i6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# QuantAgent-3uf — Acceptance Tests: Fix PositionMonitor Unit-Test Regressions\n2\t\n3\t**Issue ID:** QuantAgent-3uf\n4\t\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\t## Gate Command (authoritative)\n8\t\n9\t```bash\n10\tDATABASE_URL=postgresql://test:test@localhost:5432/quantagent_test \\\n11\t  /mnt/actions-runner/autodev-runtime/venvs/QuantAgent/.venv/bin/python \\\n12\t  -m pytest tests/ -v --tb=short --maxfail=10 -m \"not integration and not slow\"\n13\t```\n14\t\n15\tAll tests previously failing must now pass. No new failures introduced.\n16\t\n17\t---\n18\t\n19\t## AC-1: `test_only_one_active_position_per_symbol` PASSES\n20\t\n21\t**Given:** A fresh, empty database  \n22\t**When:** The test opens one position, closes it, opens another  \n23\t**Then:** Exactly 1 active position exists after each open; the second active is SELL  \n24\t\n25\t**Verification:**\n26\t```bash\n27\tpytest tests/test_position_monitor.py::test_only_one_active_position_per_symbol -v --tb=short\n28\t# Expected: PASSED\n29\t```\n30\t\n31\t**Failure mode before fix:** `assert 46 == 1` (stale data from previous runs)\n32\t\n33\t---\n34\t\n35\t## AC-2: `test_position_with_all_optional_fields` PASSES\n36\t\n37\t**Given:** Actual Trade and Signal records exist in the DB  \n38\t**When:** `open_position()` is called with `trade_id=<real_id>` and `signal_id=<real_id>`  \n39\t**Then:** The position is committed without FK violation; all optional fields are set correctly  \n40\t\n41\t**Verification:**\n42\t```bash\n43\tpytest tests/test_position_monitor_constraints.py::test_position_with_all_optional_fields -v --tb=short\n44\t# Expected: PASSED\n45\t```\n46\t\n47\t**Failure mode before fix:** `sqlalchemy.exc.IntegrityError: ForeignKeyViolation (trade_id=123 not present)`\n48\t\n49\t---\n50\t\n51\t## AC-3: `test_get_active_position_returns_most_recent_if_multiple` PASSES\n52\t\n53\t**Given:** A fresh DB with pos1 created via monitor, pos2 inserted directly  \n54\t**When:** `get_active_position(\"BTCUSDT\")` is called  \n55\t**Then:** Returns pos1 (oldest, lowest id) due to deterministic `ORDER BY id ASC`  \n56\t\n57\t**Verification:**\n58\t```bash\n59\tpytest tests/test_position_monitor_constraints.py::test_get_active_position_returns_most_recent_if_multiple -v --tb=short\n60\t# Expected: PASSED\n61\t```\n62\t\n63\t**Failure mode before fix:** `assert 1 == 96` (returned oldest stale record instead of current test's pos1)\n64\t\n65\t---\n66\t\n67\t## AC-4: `test_closed_position_not_returned_by_get_active` PASSES\n68\t\n69\t**Given:** A fresh DB  \n70\t**When:** A position is opened and immediately closed  \n71\t**Then:** `get_active_position()` returns `None` (no other active positions in DB)  \n72\t\n73\t**Verification:**\n74\t```bash\n75\tpytest tests/test_position_monitor_constraints.py::test_closed_position_not_returned_by_get_active -v --tb=short\n76\t# Expected: PASSED\n77\t```\n78\t\n79\t**Failure mode before fix:** Returned stale active BTCUSDT positions from prior runs\n80\t\n81\t---\n82\t\n83\t## AC-5: Full gate passes without new regressions\n84\t\n85\t**Given:** All changes are applied  \n86\t**When:** The full CI gate command runs  \n87\t**Then:** All previously-passing tests still pass; the 4 fixed tests now pass  \n88\t\n89\t**Verification:**\n90\t```bash\n91\tDATABASE_URL=postgresql://test:test@localhost:5432/quantagent_test \\\n92\t  /mnt/actions-runner/autodev-runtime/venvs/QuantAgent/.venv/bin/python \\\n93\t  -m pytest tests/ -v --tb=short --maxfail=10 -m \"not integration and not slow\" \\\n94\t  | tail -5\n95\t# Expected: no FAILED lines; 4 previously-failing tests now show PASSED\n96\t```\n97\t\n98\t---\n99\t\n100\t## AC-6: Tests run with no DATABASE_URL (SQLite fallback)\n101\t\n102\t**Given:** `DATABASE_URL` is not set in the environment  \n103\t**When:** The test suite runs  \n104\t**Then:** All 4 tests pass using the `conftest.py` SQLite in-memory fixture  \n105\t\n106\t**Verification:**\n107\t```bash\n108\tunset DATABASE_URL\n109\t/mnt/actions-runner/autodev-runtime/venvs/QuantAgent/.venv/bin/python \\\n110\t  -m pytest tests/test_position_monitor.py tests/test_position_monitor_constraints.py \\\n111\t  -v --tb=short\n112\t# Expected: all tests PASSED (SQLite in-memory from conftest.py)\n113\t```\n114\t\n115\t---\n116\t\n117\t## Non-Regression Checks\n118\t\n119\tThe following existing passing tests must remain green after changes:\n120\t\n121\t```bash\n122\tpytest tests/test_position_monitor.py -v --tb=short -m \"not integration and not slow\"\n123\tpytest tests/test_position_monitor_constraints.py -v --tb=short -m \"not integration and not slow\"\n124\t```\n125\t\n126\tSpecifically, tests that were already passing before this fix:\n127\t- `test_open_position`\n128\t- `test_get_active_position`\n129\t- `test_update_candle_tracking_*`\n130\t- `test_close_position_*`\n131\t- `test_active_position_has_required_fields`\n132\t- `test_default_values_are_correct`\n133\t- `test_candles_since_entry_never_decrements`\n134\t- `test_candles_direction_never_exceeds_prediction_horizon`\n135\t- `test_accuracy_is_between_zero_and_one`\n136\t- `test_closed_position_has_closed_at_timestamp`\n137\t- `test_close_already_closed_position_is_idempotent`\n138\t- `test_update_tracking_on_closed_position_still_increments`\n139\t- `test_zero_quantity_position`\n140\t- `test_candle_tracking_with_equal_prices`\n141\t- `test_accuracy_calculation_*`\n142\t- `test_all_exit_policies_can_be_set`\n143\t- `test_position_persists_after_session_close`\n144\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b9b65c5-e77e-400b-90aa-d1fae3699661","uuid":"67c6d7e9-ed7a-4de8-b869-3a83428f2500","timestamp":"2026-05-09T02:42:04.313Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/azureuser/repos/projects/QuantAgent/docs/05_acceptance_tests/QuantAgent-3uf-AC-fix-positionmonitor-unit-test-regression.md","content":"# QuantAgent-3uf — Acceptance Tests: Fix PositionMonitor Unit-Test Regressions\n\n**Issue ID:** QuantAgent-3uf\n\n---\n\n## Gate Command (authoritative)\n\n```bash\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://test:test@localhost:5432/quantagent_test \\\n  /mnt/actions-runner/autodev-runtime/venvs/QuantAgent/.venv/bin/python \\\n  -m pytest tests/ -v --tb=short --maxfail=10 -m \"not integration and not slow\"\n```\n\nAll tests previously failing must now pass. No new failures introduced.\n\n---\n\n## AC-1: `test_only_one_active_position_per_symbol` PASSES\n\n**Given:** A fresh, empty database  \n**When:** The test opens one position, closes it, opens another  \n**Then:** Exactly 1 active position exists after each open; the second active is SELL  \n\n**Verification:**\n```bash\npytest tests/test_position_monitor.py::test_only_one_active_position_per_symbol -v --tb=short\n# Expected: PASSED\n```\n\n**Failure mode before fix:** `assert 46 == 1` (stale data from previous runs)\n\n---\n\n## AC-2: `test_position_with_all_optional_fields` PASSES\n\n**Given:** Actual Trade and Signal records exist in the DB  \n**When:** `open_position()` is called with `trade_id=<real_id>` and `signal_id=<real_id>`  \n**Then:** The position is committed without FK violation; all optional fields are set correctly  \n\n**Verification:**\n```bash\npytest tests/test_position_monitor_constraints.py::test_position_with_all_optional_fields -v --tb=short\n# Expected: PASSED\n```\n\n**Failure mode before fix:** `sqlalchemy.exc.IntegrityError: ForeignKeyViolation (trade_id=123 not present)`\n\n---\n\n## AC-3: `test_get_active_position_returns_most_recent_if_multiple` PASSES\n\n**Given:** A fresh DB with pos1 created via monitor, pos2 inserted directly  \n**When:** `get_active_position(\"BTCUSDT\")` is called  \n**Then:** Returns pos1 (oldest, lowest id) due to deterministic `ORDER BY id ASC`  \n\n**Verification:**\n```bash\npytest tests/test_position_monitor_constraints.py::test_get_active_position_returns_most_recent_if_multiple -v --tb=short\n# Expected: PASSED\n```\n\n**Failure mode before fix:** `assert 1 == 96` (returned oldest stale record instead of current test's pos1)\n\n---\n\n## AC-4: `test_closed_position_not_returned_by_get_active` PASSES\n\n**Given:** A fresh DB  \n**When:** A position is opened and immediately closed  \n**Then:** `get_active_position()` returns `None` (no other active positions in DB)  \n\n**Verification:**\n```bash\npytest tests/test_position_monitor_constraints.py::test_closed_position_not_returned_by_get_active -v --tb=short\n# Expected: PASSED\n```\n\n**Failure mode before fix:** Returned stale active BTCUSDT positions from prior runs\n\n---\n\n## AC-5: Full gate passes without new regressions\n\n**Given:** All changes are applied  \n**When:** The full CI gate command runs  \n**Then:** All previously-passing tests still pass; the 4 fixed tests now pass  \n\n**Verification:**\n```bash\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://test:test@localhost:5432/quantagent_test \\\n  /mnt/actions-runner/autodev-runtime/venvs/QuantAgent/.venv/bin/python \\\n  -m pytest tests/ -v --tb=short --maxfail=10 -m \"not integration and not slow\" \\\n  | tail -5\n# Expected: no FAILED lines; 4 previously-failing tests now show PASSED\n```\n\n---\n\n## AC-6: Tests run with no DATABASE_URL (SQLite fallback)\n\n**Given:** `DATABASE_URL` is not set in the environment  \n**When:** The test suite runs  \n**Then:** All 4 tests pass using the `conftest.py` SQLite in-memory fixture  \n\n**Verification:**\n```bash\nunset DATABASE_URL\n/mnt/actions-runner/autodev-runtime/venvs/QuantAgent/.venv/bin/python \\\n  -m pytest tests/test_position_monitor.py tests/test_position_monitor_constraints.py \\\n  -v --tb=short\n# Expected: all tests PASSED (SQLite in-memory from conftest.py)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Non-Regression Checks\n\nThe following existing passing tests must remain green after changes:\n\n```bash\npytest tests/test_position_monitor.py -v --tb=short -m \"not integration and not slow\"\npytest tests/test_position_monitor_constraints.py -v --tb=short -m \"not integration and not slow\"\n```\n\nSpecifically, tests that were already passing before this fix:\n- `test_open_position`\n- `test_get_active_position`\n- `test_update_candle_tracking_*`\n- `test_close_position_*`\n- `test_active_position_has_required_fields`\n- `test_default_values_are_correct`\n- `test_candles_since_entry_never_decrements`\n- `test_candles_direction_never_exceeds_prediction_horizon`\n- `test_accuracy_is_between_zero_and_one`\n- `test_closed_position_has_closed_at_timestamp`\n- `test_close_already_closed_position_is_idempotent`\n- `test_update_tracking_on_closed_position_still_increments`\n- `test_zero_quantity_position`\n- `test_candle_tracking_with_equal_prices`\n- `test_accuracy_calculation_*`\n- `test_all_exit_policies_can_be_set`\n- `test_position_persists_after_session_close`\n","numLines":144,"startLine":1,"totalLines":144}}}
